---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy | Heatherlea Holiday Cottage"
  description="Our Privacy Policy"
>

<section>

  <header class="section-header">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </header>

    <div class="prose-container">

    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 2026</p>

    <p>At Heatherlea Holiday Cottage, we are committed to protecting your personal privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you visit our website or get in touch with us.</p>

    <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>If you choose to contact us using the webform or contact details listed on our website, we will receive your contact details (such as your name, email address, or telephone number) and any details or message content you provide regarding your enquiry or booking.</p>

    <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <p>Any information you provide is strictly used to respond to your enquiries, to manage and confirm your bookings, and provide customer support and follow-up advice.</p>
    <p>We never sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h3>3. Cookies and Analytics</h3>
    <p>Our website is designed to be privacy-friendly. We do not use intrusive tracking cookies or personal data profiling. Third-party embedded widgets (such as Google Maps or review displays) may set necessary performance or functional cookies to display properly. For more information check our <a href="/cookies">Cookies Policy</a>.</p>

    <h3>4. Data Storage and Security</h3>
    <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational precautions to ensure that any personal information shared with us via email or telephone is stored securely and accessed only by authorized personnel.</p>

    <h3>5. Your Rights (UK GDPR)</h3>
    <p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to request a copy of any personal data we hold about you, or request that we correct or delete your personal information. If you wish to exercise any of these rights, please contact us directly.</p>

    <h3>6. Contact Us</h3>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@heatherlea-otterburn.co.uk">privacy@heatherlea-otterburn.co.uk</a></p>
    
  </div>

    <div class="prose-container">

    <a href="/"><strong>Return to Home</strong></a>

  </div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>